        "Artificial Intelligence (AI) has become the new buzzword - a newly integral part of society, able to carry out tasks from making videos to data analysis. Traditionally, AI has been measured against human intelligence, perpetuating an anthropocentric view that limits its conceptualization. With many researchers aiming to make AI a humanoid partner, the current paradigm within Cognitive Science and AI research is overtly and selfishly human-focused. (Korteling et al., 2021).",
